// Bundle the sound render-host runner (lib/cyrus/sound/runner-cli.ts + its pure DSP imports) into ONE plain Node file,
// lib/cyrus/sound/runner.bundle.cjs, which host.ts ships to node-2 (content-addressed). Committed, so the portal
